The Spark leads [[Org/Pyrelight/index|Pyrelight]]. When Pyrelight reached beyond [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Teller's Run/index|Teller's Run]], the Spark went to the shopkeepers on the streets that border his district and the [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Masque District/index|Masque District]], and asked each of them to bend the knee. Those who refused were dragged into his district, tied to effigies, and burned.

He stands seven feet tall, nearly all of it in his long legs, and his legs are charred as if they were held in a fire. He walks on them without trouble. An ivory mask covers half his face.
